# --- Instructor-only material (NEVER commit to the student repo) ---
# The generator and the bound tool ARE shipped -- students need them to make
# practice instances.  What stays behind: the hidden seed and its instances,
# the reference solver (a complete implementation of exactly the techniques
# the assignment asks students to find), the reference tours, and the design
# notes.
